1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
Excuse me, does this bus go to the city center?

2
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:05,750
Yes, it does. You can get off at the third stop.

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,380
Great, thanks. How much is the fare?

4
00:00:08,730 --> 00:00:11,850
It's two dollars and fifty cents. You can pay with a card.

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,360
Perfect. I have my card ready.

6
00:00:14,709 --> 00:00:17,149
Sounds good. I'll let you know when we get there.
